# Committed on purpose: every value here is NEXT_PUBLIC_* — meant to
# be embedded in the browser bundle and protected by Row Level
# Security, not by secrecy. This is what lets Vercel build correctly
# without a separate environment-variable configuration step.
#
# NEVER add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, or any other
# non-NEXT_PUBLIC_ secret to this file — those bypass RLS / hold real
# privileges and must only be set as encrypted env vars in the Vercel
# dashboard (Project Settings > Environment Variables).
